  "content": "<div class=\"p-8 font-sans max-w-lg mx-auto bg-amber-50 text-amber-950 rounded-2xl border-4 border-dashed border-orange-500/30 relative shadow-xl m-4\">\n  <div class=\"text-center space-y-4\">\n    <div class=\"text-5xl\">🌽🔥🪁🌾</div>\n    <span class=\"text-[10px] bg-orange-200 text-orange-950 font-mono font-bold tracking-widest py-1 px-3 rounded uppercase\">Olha a Chuva! É Mentira! 🎉</span>\n    <h1 class=\"text-4xl font-extrabold uppercase text-orange-600 tracking-tight leading-none font-serif\">Arraiá de Documestre</h1>\n    \n    <p class=\"text-xs text-amber-900 leading-relaxed max-w-sm mx-auto\">\n      Prepara o remendo na calça e o vestido de chita porcausa que o nosso casamento caipira de <strong class=\"text-orange-700\">{{nome_noivos_caipiras}}</strong> vai começar com muita fogueira, canjica e quentão!\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"my-6 border-y-2 border-orange-200 py-3 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-center bg-orange-100/30 rounded-xl\">\n      <div>\n        <span class=\"block text-[8px] font-mono text-orange-600 uppercase\">Dia de Arraiá</span>\n        <strong class=\"text-sm text-amber-950\">{{data_arraia}}</strong>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <span class=\"block text-[8px] font-mono text-orange-600 uppercase\">A partir das</span>\n        <strong class=\"text-sm text-amber-950\">{{hora_arraia}} HS</strong>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bg-amber-100 p-3 rounded-xl text-center border border-amber-200\">\n      <span class=\"block text-[8px] font-mono text-amber-600 uppercase\">Nosso terreiro está em</span>\n      <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950\">{{local_arraia}}</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-amber-800 italic\">\n      Traje Recomendado: <strong class=\"text-orange-700\">{{detalhe_traje}}</strong>\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"pt-4 text-center\">\n      <span class=\"inline-block bg-orange-600 hover:bg-orange-700 text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider py-2 px-5 rounded shadow-lg\">\n        Confirmar Zap do Arraiá: {{contato_pipoca}} 🌽\n      </span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
